"┌ Help — all keybindings (j/k scroll · any key closes) ────────────────────────┐"
"│  ←/→ h/l    focus column                 r          retry run (asks first)   │"
"│  ↑/↓ k/j    focus card                   q / Esc    back to board            │"
"│  b          switch board                forms                                │"
"│  n          new card                     Tab        next field               │"
"│  N          new column                   Shift+Tab  previous field           │"
"│  e          edit card                    ←/→ Space  cycle a picker field     │"
"│  E          edit focused column          Ctrl+E     edit textarea in $EDITOR │"
"│  a          archive / restore card       Enter      submit                   │"
"│  v          cycle active/all/archived    Esc        cancel                   │"
"│  d          delete card                 picker / confirm                     │"
"│  D          delete/move column cards     ↑/↓ k/j    move selection           │"
"│  m          move card (board→column)     Enter      choose                   │"
"│  M          move focused column          b          other board (moving)     │"
"│  H / L      shove card left / right      y / n      confirm / decline        │"
"│  Enter      card detail                  q / Esc    cancel                   │"
"│  T          apply template (empty)      move column (M)                      │"
"│  r / R      refresh board                ←/→ h/l    stage the reorder        │"
"│  ?          this help (any screen)       Enter      commit the reorder       │"
"│  q / Esc    back / quit                  q / Esc    discard                  │"
"│ card detail                             sheets                               │"
"│  Enter      confirm done (awaiting)      k/j Enter  switcher: move / open    │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
